hard.body:
Hello,

Two things. Our August invoice still shows our old office address; we moved in July and updated it in the billing settings. Our accounts team cannot book the invoice until the address is right, and the books close at the end of next week.

Second, and less important: the Reports page has been a bit slow for me this week, maybe 5 or 6 seconds to load.

Best regards,
{full}
{role}, {company}

Hi there,

Do you offer a nonprofit discount? We are a registered charity with {seats} staff, and the Team plan is a stretch for our budget. Happy to send proof of our status.

Kind regards,
{full}
{company}

Hi {agent},

Still cannot get in. The new reset link you sent also says 'link expired' as soon as I open it, even when I click it straight away. I have a client call in two hours and all my notes are in there.

{first}

Hello,

Please help us add our two new hires to the workspace. Both invitations bounce back with 'invitation not valid' and they start on Monday.

Also, could you send me last month's invoice again? I cannot find the email.

Best,
{full}
{role}, {company}

Hi {agent},

Same problem again after your fix. The sync ran at 06:00 and duplicated every contact again; we now have each contact three times. Our sales team cannot work with this list today.

{first}

Hi {agent},

It is down again: the same 503 on all our workspaces since 13:05. Our customers cannot reach their portals.

{first}

Hi team,

We would love a Kanban view. It is the main thing stopping us from moving our design team over this month.

Small thing too: how do I rename a board?

Thanks,
{full}
{role}, {company}

Hi {agent},

+1 to this from our side as well. Any update on the roadmap?

{first}

This is the THIRD time I am asking: where is the bulk-delete API endpoint your sales rep promised us? Our developers are fed up with deleting records one by one. We plan our next sprint on Friday and need to know if it is coming.

{full}
{role}, {company}

Hello,

Please close my account and remove everything you have about me from your systems. And stop charging my card from now on.

{full}

Hi,

Our last invoice has the wrong VAT rate, can you check it?

Also, a former employee has asked us for a copy of all the personal data about them in your app. How do we handle that? We want to answer within the month.

Best regards,
{full}
{role}, {company}

Hello,

Following up: it has now been 25 days since my access request, and I have not received anything. The legal deadline is in 5 days.

{full}

